  - line: 12
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_focus: Geralt bonds with the Dragon Mail; Zaron, Applicator, and Geralt negotiate a three-consciousness truce as Geralt begins learning to move in the armor."
  - line: 13
    type: narration
